// 2. The strategy is simplified to a single constrained SQL span. We open `<<`
//    once, generate SQL entirely inside the constrained region, and after
//    closing `>>` we immediately prefer EOS. This matches the evaluation
//    requirement that output contain `<< >>` while avoiding accidental extra
//    prose.
//
