// tracked constrained prefix accordingly, preserving validity. In the close and
// outside branches, either constrained mode is exited or remains false, so the
// implication is vacuous.
//
// suffix: After opening, the tracked constrained content is empty, so it is
// trivially the suffix of `generated`. In the inside-append branch,
// `AppendConstrainedToken` appends the same token to both `generated` and the
// tracked constrained prefix, preserving the suffix equality. In close and
// outside branches, constrained mode is false afterward or remains false, so the
// invariant holds vacuously.
//
